      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5004_Task6" name="Recover cost &amp; learn: recover remediation cost from the installer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Recover cost &amp; learn: recover remediation cost from the installer (retention/bond/fee per agreement), feed the scorecard (W5002) and QA (W5003), and manage disputes (W5005)
Responsible (R): Warranty / Finance / Legal / Network Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per claim</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5004_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5004_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
