Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: ~100–200 disputes/complaints per year across the network
Owner: CX (VS-13) / Pro-Referral Network Manager / Legal (VS-100)
Participants: CX (VS-13), Legal (VS-100), Installer, Customer, Ethics (VS-119), Quality (VS-31)
Source: workflow W5005 — Dispute Resolution, Complaint Handling &amp; Installer Discipline/Removal</bpmn:documentation>
