Volume: Quarterly compliance monitoring across the ~300–500-installer network
Owner: Compliance (VS-165/VS-22/VS-166) / Pro-Referral Network Manager
Participants: Compliance (VS-165/VS-166), Legal (VS-100), Insurance (VS-26), TPRM (VS-161), Installer
Source: workflow W5006 — License, Insurance &amp; Compliance Continuous Monitoring</bpmn:documentation>
