      <bpmn:userTask id="W5006_Task4" name="Continuously monitor licenses/insurance: track PCAB license (RA 4566 — links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Continuously monitor licenses/insurance: track PCAB license (RA 4566 — links VS-165), trade licenses, insurance, permits for expiration/lapse, verify against official registers, and alert on lapse (links VS-166 license portfolio)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Insurance / Marketplace
Accountable (A): Compliance Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5006_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5006_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5006_Task5" name="Re-verify periodically: periodic re-verification of license/insurance/financial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Re-verify periodically: periodic re-verification of license/insurance/financial standing (links W4987/W4988), sanctions/ethics re-screen (VS-86/VS-119), and quality re-assessment (W5003)
Responsible (R): Compliance / TPRM / Quality
Accountable (A): Compliance Lead
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5006_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5006_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5006_Task6" name="Act on lapse/non-compliance: suspend referrals on lapse, require…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Act on lapse/non-compliance: suspend referrals on lapse, require remediation/reactivation, remove for serious lapse (W5005), and feed the scorecard (W5002) and TPRM (VS-161)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Network Manager / Legal
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Event-driven</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5006_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5006_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
