      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly review; strategic review (VS-33)
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly deep-dive
Volume: ~1 program analytics across the network
Owner: Pro-Referral Network Manager / Analytics / Strategy (VS-33)
Participants: Analytics (VS-28), Strategy (VS-33), Finance (VS-17.4), CX (VS-13), Services (VS-12)
Source: workflow W5007 — Network Health, Revenue Impact &amp; Program Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5007_LaneSet4">
