      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5007_Task6" name="Analyze network health: coverage/fill-rate (W4991), response/completion times…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Analyze network health: coverage/fill-rate (W4991), response/completion times, installer rating/scorecard (W5002), churn, disputes (W5005), and compliance (W5006) — by trade/area
Responsible (R): Analytics / Network Manager / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5007_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5007_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5007_Task7" name="Analyze revenue impact: referral volume, materials attach/sales lift (W4996)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Analyze revenue impact: referral volume, materials attach/sales lift (W4996), referral-fee revenue (W4997), financing/warranty attach (VS-154/VS-53), CLV/basket impact, and cost-to-serve
Responsible (R): Finance / Analytics / Network Manager
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5007_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5007_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
