        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Recommend &amp; prioritize: improvements to coverage (W4991), economics (W4985/W4997), quality/compliance (W5003/W5006), and platform/UX (W4990); feed strategy and the leadership review
Responsible (R): Strategy / Network Manager / Analytics
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5007_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5007_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
